      "text": "center_discrimination (optional)\n_center_discrimination /\nset_discrimination_reference\nsubtracts pool-mean a_ref from every a_m\n-- lossless for within-query ranking",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
