      "text": "QueryBank.neighbor_weighted_mean\n(vecs, store, k, weighting)\n(training/retrieval/query_bank.py)\nTHE ONE weighting primitive:\ncosine-sim-weighted mean of k nearest,\nmax(cos,0) normalized; falls back\nto a plain mean if all weights vanish",
